{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.065897273292785219,"y":0.044725779988263992,"h":0.016653091152905697,"w":0.12799926757812499,"c":1},{"h":0.017426289184892862,"t":"which live out in the high seas but have their nesting sites on the American coast, we need.","x":0.065922942426362763,"y":0.091611200690256522,"c":1,"w":0.77745407104492192},{"y":0.10892542554740503,"t":"to create corridors for migration, so they can get from one area to another safely. As well as","c":1,"w":0.77731959025065112,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.065979380043800495},{"y":0.1250000001671111,"h":0.015988371754420583,"t":"this, action needs to be taken to lower the levels of fishing quotas to prevent overfishing of","w":0.76907216389973954,"c":1,"x":0.065979381866257819},{"x":0.065912664791866485,"w":0.78570114135742186,"c":1,"h":0.018942639747928647,"y":0.13884085316466721,"t":"endangered species. And finally, there's the problem of 'by-catch'. This refers to the catching"},{"t":"of unwanted fish by fishing boats - they're retumed to the sea, but they're often dead or","h":0.019113772488032366,"x":0.065914560606718173,"c":1,"w":0.7465189615885417,"y":0.15516248244776198},{"c":1,"y":0.17293012337415248,"t":"dying. If these commercial fishing boats used equipment which was more selective, so that","x":0.065979386834182877,"w":0.77525772094726553,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"c":1,"w":0.71340204874674473,"y":0.18895348827883696,"t":"only the fish wanted for consumption were caught, this problem could be overcome.","x":0.065979384327658583,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"x":0.068041231323624315,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.28247423807779948,"y":0.21366279062537097,"c":1,"t":"OK. So does anyone have any ..."},{"t":"TEST 2","x":0.40618556790630539,"y":0.26744186011686122,"w":0.1113402048746745,"h":0.026162790958138005,"c":1},{"t":"SECTION 1","x":0.063917526193121244,"h":0.017441859892096456,"y":0.33430232585657937,"w":0.16907216389973959,"c":1},{"x":0.063917520471518927,"t":"CAROLINE: Good Morning. Youth Council. Caroline speaking.","y":0.36482558155011524,"w":0.50927836100260426,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"x":0.065918123975048981,"w":0.055792617797851565,"c":1,"y":0.383552032677698,"t":"ROGER:","h":0.010512213670570425},{"w":0.70529830932617199,"x":0.15250013638752261,"h":0.019031849456267347,"t":"Oh, hello, I'm interested in standing for election to the Youth Council, and I was told","y":0.37957361001041345,"c":1},{"w":0.15081403096516929,"x":0.15241852279738902,"h":0.014017943977539638,"t":"to give you a call.","y":0.39807834099388439,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.076490338643391928,"t":"CAROLINE:","x":0.065878541912274144,"y":0.41530819194721436,"h":0.010953383521339344},{"y":0.41279069739589092,"w":0.39587628682454423,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"x":0.14845360907208516,"t":"That's good. Could I have your name, please?"},{"t":"ROGER:","h":0.0098683093480340656,"y":0.43111235692813699,"w":0.058059310913085943,"x":0.063753849557998898,"c":1},{"x":0.15051546607310484,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.1896907170613607,"c":1,"y":0.43012331179185415,"t":"Yes, it's Roger Brown."},{"t":"CAROLINE:","y":0.44761788662690005,"c":1,"x":0.065963397591816963,"h":0.010287482529896086,"w":0.072196915944417323},{"w":0.68453608194986981,"x":0.14639175273703386,"t":"Thank you. I'm Caroline, the Youth Council administrator. So do you know much","c":1,"y":0.44622093039942223,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"w":0.31340207417805988,"y":0.46212566059344673,"c":1,"t":"about what the Council does, Roger?","x":0.15463916902203304,"h":0.013211978860833806},{"y":0.48105112596806254,"w":0.055703709920247382,"x":0.063900722252471343,"t":"ROGER:","h":0.0088279805880606688,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.53402064005533856,"t":"I've talked to Stephanie - I think she's the chair of the Council.","x":0.1484535975894816,"y":0.47674418619764425,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"y":0.4941280096127012,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"CAROLINE: That's right.","x":0.061855672382769643,"c":1,"w":0.18969071706136068},{"x":0.063735337100663536,"w":0.054037933349609379,"y":0.51121940095882301,"h":0.010024631296405295,"t":"ROGER:","c":1},{"w":0.69484537760416665,"t":"issues, for example, and make suggestions to the town council. That's what made","x":0.1525773111030988,"c":1,"y":0.52613035798062546,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"me interested.","w":0.12371134440104165,"x":0.15257731741165392,"c":1,"y":0.54360465141114189,"h":0.010174418083723991},{"t":"Fine. Well let me take down some of your details. First of all, how old are you? You","x":0.14845359791686141,"w":0.70309280395507812,"c":1,"y":0.55813270701128537,"h":0.015995199793727655},{"y":0.57398708174758106,"w":0.49278350830078133,"h":0.013222220639796056,"x":0.15051546226334114,"c":1,"t":"know the Council is for young people aged from 13 to 18?"},{"h":0.010270642310258427,"y":0.59152165541799007,"c":1,"t":"ROGER:","x":0.061839239956350552,"w":0.059826672871907551},{"y":0.60901162803740683,"c":1,"x":0.063917525047429147,"t":"CAROLINE:","w":0.074226805369059262,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"t":"ROGER:","y":0.62491113565508682,"c":1,"x":0.061828874795519531,"h":0.0088986588868406047,"w":0.057785549163818367},{"c":1,"x":0.15051546787507045,"t":"I've just turned 18.","w":0.16082473754882812,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.59011627884113416},{"x":0.15257731843582206,"c":1,"t":"And where do you live, Roger?","y":0.6059894302157498,"w":0.26185567220052086,"h":0.014679976512037674},{"t":"Well, that's a bit complicated. At the moment I'm looking for a flat to rent here,","c":1,"w":0.66185567220052088,"x":0.14845360707124125,"y":0.62209302342201678,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"x":0.14845361268839924,"c":1,"w":0.66185567220052088,"t":"so I'm in a hostel from Monday to Friday. I go back to my parents' place at the","h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.63652378182578384},{"x":0.14837929769002084,"t":"weekend.","w":0.086746559143066393,"c":1,"y":0.65524216080398434,"h":0.012190096950922991},{"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"w":0.08247422536214194,"y":0.67296511640949985,"t":"CAROLINE:","x":0.061855670708862338},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"OK, so where's the best place to send you some information about the Council?","y":0.66999412816323611,"c":1,"x":0.14639175955336081,"w":0.68247421264648434},{"x":0.061833700846338061,"w":0.055714041392008473,"h":0.0088611430304231797,"c":1,"t":"ROGER:","y":0.68888338195665932},{"c":1,"t":"Oh, to my parents' address, please. That's 17, Buckleigh Street - B-U-C-K-L-E-I-","w":0.68865976969401044,"x":0.15051547113237632,"y":0.68459302332430061,"h":0.017441859892096456},{"y":0.70199647707537061,"h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"t":"G-H Street, Stamford, Lincolnshire, though you don't really need the county.","x":0.14845360390252543,"w":0.64742268880208331},{"x":0.059696447791080992,"h":0.019232682179368576,"c":1,"y":0.71666202950382596,"w":0.6558990478515625,"t":"CAROLINE: Oh, I know Stamford - it's a lovely town. And what's the postcode?"},{"h":0.011051941813963406,"c":1,"t":"ROGER:","w":0.058031050364176433,"y":0.73647984302188829,"x":0.061706124160585317},{"x":0.063917525503209394,"c":1,"t":"CAROLINE:","w":0.072164948781331395,"h":0.0087209299460481171,"y":0.75290697687461616},{"y":0.76889534896229561,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"w":0.055670102437337235,"t":"ROGER:","x":0.061855670314836547},{"c":1,"t":"PE9 ZQI","x":0.14845360925707335,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.08247422536214194,"y":0.73399882573001685},{"h":0.016001174398120988,"x":0.14845361237817969,"w":0.55257731119791664,"y":0.75000000016515922,"c":1,"t":"Right, thank you. So are you working here, or are you a student?"},{"y":0.7659701755174001,"t":"I started studying at the university a couple of weeks ago, and I've got a part-time","w":0.69493459065755203,"h":0.015833371398173091,"x":0.14634112904275506,"c":1},{"h":0.013211978860833917,"t":"job for a few hours a week.","w":0.23505154927571617,"y":0.78332354640289237,"c":1,"x":0.14639175102849619},{"c":1,"x":0.061785417159556294,"t":"CAROLINE:","w":0.080552876790364575,"h":0.010740533269858688,"y":0.80058903567442241},{"x":0.14845360689753004,"y":0.79941860469301962,"w":0.1484536107381185,"t":"What do you do?","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.010551149118527614,"y":0.81667209983010691,"t":"ROGER:","x":0.061789913979353461,"w":0.057863470713297532},{"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"Well, I've done several diiferent things. I've just finished a short-term contract as a","x":0.14845361833784637,"w":0.6969071960449218,"y":0.81532589543669176},{"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"x":0.14845362963226202,"t":"courier, and now I'm working as a waiter in one of the big hotels.","w":0.5484535725911458,"y":0.82994186043456308},{"t":"CAROLINE: Uhuh. That can't leave you much time for studying!","c":1,"w":0.52388870239257812,"x":0.059709669651621722,"y":0.84530629440533722,"h":0.017556544968610144},{"c":1,"w":0.057833735148111971,"y":0.86465528793467161,"h":0.0090615171162576891,"t":"ROGER:","x":0.061804781799016058},{"w":0.35876289367675773,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"Oh, it's not too bad. I manage to fit it all in.","x":0.15051545843080782,"y":0.86191860462250602},{"w":0.29072163899739584,"c":1,"x":0.05979381961870163,"y":0.879330593258983,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"CAROLINE: What are you studying?"},{"c":1,"t":"ROGER:","x":0.061800032497152345,"y":0.89806929459015172,"w":0.057843233744303384,"h":0.0090939689228553},{"y":0.89377256230309632,"h":0.017981392596654211,"t":"My ambition is to go into parliament eventually, so my maior subiect is golitics.","x":0.14633184297703791,"w":0.66813990275065105,"c":1},{"w":0.68865976969401044,"x":0.14845362020360672,"y":0.91133294161765699,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"That's partly why I think the Youth Council is important and want to be a part of it.","c":1},{"y":0.95348837210236626,"w":0.039175256093343096,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"108","x":0.057731959479101654},{"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.022615832576874939,"x":0.3521918184962084,"y":0.9543054561580997,"w":0.29146792093912754,"c":1},{"t":"Q39","x":0.87216494912686815,"y":0.093023255694331786,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q40","x":0.87216494917626652,"w":0.039175256093343158,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.17296511617307453},{"w":0.078711891174316428,"c":1,"x":0.86786054914165822,"y":0.4296730082703818,"t":"Example","h":0.014200495049593642},{"w":0.026804122924804608,"c":1,"t":"Q1","x":0.86804123758398954,"y":0.6380813952192439,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"x":0.86804123694476476,"t":"Q2","y":0.68749999988037824,"w":0.028865979512532558,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"x":0.86804123694476476,"y":0.73546511604829568,"w":0.028865979512532558,"t":"Q3","h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1},{"x":0.86804123694476476,"t":"Q4","y":0.83139534871758769,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"w":0.028865979512532558},{"x":0.86804123694476476,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.89389534871758769,"t":"Q5","c":1,"w":0.028865979512532558}]}